│          │MIDI                                                                                            │          │
│          │F4 or :midi outputs opens MIDI settings and lists output ports                                  │          │
│          │In MIDI settings: arrows select, Enter connects, F5/r refresh, p panic                          │          │
│          │CLI fallback: salieri --list-midi-outputs, then :midi connect 0                                 │          │
│          │4. Press Space or run :play pattern to send notes to the connected output                       │          │
│          │:midi disconnect closes the output   :midi panic sends All Notes Off                            │          │
│          │Use :track channel 2 10 to set track 02 to MIDI channel 10                                      │          │
│          │Config: [midi] default_output = "IAC Driver" auto-connects by name                              │          │
